      ],
      "source": "https://mostcajun.com/towns/maurice/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Alphonsus Church, built in January 1893, stands as Maurice’s oldest standing religious building.",
